            "id": 152330,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir rezervasyon API'si <code>201</code> durum koduyla bir rezervasyon oluşturdu. Genel başarı kontrolünü tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" create_response.ok:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Created&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"is_success\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  File &quot;/home/code/file.py&quot;, line 1, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    if create_response.ok:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"NameError: name 'create_response' is not defined\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>ok</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rezervasyon API'n <code>201</code> döndürüyor. Hata yanıtlarında false olan genel başarı özelliğini kullan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" create_response.ok:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Created&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"status_code\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"json\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>ok</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
