            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hem <code>200</code> hem de <code>201</code>'i kabul ederken <code>404</code> ve <code>500</code>'ü reddeden koşul hangisidir?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>response.ok</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.status_code == 200</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.status_code == 404</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>response.status_code &lt; 500</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>response.ok</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
